<title>UK: UK M0 grows provisional 7.5 pct in year to Aug.</title>
<headline>UK M0 grows provisional 7.5 pct in year to Aug.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England released the following provisional data on M0 money supply -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY (in pct)	   Aug		  July*</p>
<p>    M0 in month (adjusted)	  0.9		  0.4</p>
<p>    M0 annual (adjusted)	    7.5		  7.1</p>
<p>    M0 in month (unadjusted) 1.8	   1.5</p>
<p>    M0 annual (unadjusted)	  7.7		  7.3</p>
<p>* previously available figures</p>
<p>NOTE - consensus forecast 7.0 pct yr/yr s/adj growth.</p>
</text>
